{
  "name": "Appointment Waitlist Backfill",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📅 APPOINTMENT WAITLIST BACKFILL\n**What it does:** A cancellation hits the webhook → waitlist is scored deterministically (wait time, no-shows, loyalty, priority) → top N candidates get a WhatsApp/SMS offer with an AI-written message → first `TAKE` reply wins via a second webhook → unclaimed offers expire after your reply window → owner gets Telegram summaries at every stage.\n\n**You’ll need:**\n- n8n (self-hosted or cloud)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credential + a spreadsheet with `Waitlist` and `Offers` tabs\n- A WhatsApp/SMS provider (Twilio, 360dialog, WATI…) — the send node is a clearly-marked demo placeholder you point at your provider\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n- (Optional) OpenAI API key for the AI-written offer copy\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `NEW` → `RANKED` → `OFFER_SENT` → `BOOKED` / `EXPIRED`",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 5600,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "5ad2319e-ac4e-47f7-87aa-b1c24bdbc4db",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Cancellation intake + config\nWebhook `waitlist-cancel` receives the freed slot (appointment_id, slot_time, service) → config loaded → normalized → logged to the Offers tab with status `NEW`.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 4
      },
